&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Kalapuya Building, 4500 SW Research Way, Corvallis&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Benton County Board of Commissioners&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;COL Paul Dyer, Commander, 41st Infantry Brigade Combat Team, Oregon National Guard&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Mark Lapinskas, Benton County Lead Veterans Service Officer&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Cecil Owens, ESGR State Chair&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Kenzie Singiser, OSU Music Program, National Anthem&lt;/li&gt;
