&lt;p&gt;K-9 Millie was named by then 5-year-old Violet, who submitted the name as part of &lt;a href="https://youtu.be/HJNHAcKv8fQ?si=ZqQcCtkIn7awdcIB"&gt;OSP&rsquo;s &ldquo;Name Our K-9&rdquo;&lt;/a&gt; contest last year. She chose the name in remembrance of her twin sister, Millie, who had unexpectedly passed away earlier that year. Millie loved animals, and her family had been looking for a way to honor her memory. May the contributions of K-9 Millie serve as an ongoing remembrance of Millie Melton. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

