&lt;p&gt;Honoring Corporal Tom Millsap&rsquo;s memory, we shared the news of his unexpected passing on Sunday, October 26th, while he was at home with family. Tom served in the Washington County jail beginning in 2001 and was a Veteran of the Army before joining the Sheriff&rsquo;s Office. Tom&rsquo;s dedication, easy-going demeanor, and quiet professionalism will be missed.&lt;/p&gt;

