&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW18061395 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW18061395 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&ldquo;With its full calendar of events&amp;nbsp;year-round,&amp;nbsp;Director Park&amp;nbsp;has come to&amp;nbsp;feel&amp;nbsp;like&amp;nbsp;Downtown Portland&rsquo;s&amp;nbsp;family room, a place where families can gather, celebrate, and rediscover the joy of being downtown&amp;nbsp;for the&amp;nbsp;holidays,&rdquo;&amp;nbsp;said&amp;nbsp;Sydney Mead,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Director of Downtown Programs&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;Downtown Portland Clean &amp;amp; Safe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;. &ldquo;For our small retailers, the holiday season is essential, often&amp;nbsp;driving&amp;nbsp;a large portion&amp;nbsp;of their yearly revenue. When people shop and dine&amp;nbsp;downtown, those dollars stay local, support&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;entrepreneurial community, and help build a stronger, more resilient Portland.&rdquo;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW18061395 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align:justify"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Emily Halvorson, Director of Activations for Downtown Portland Clean &amp;amp; Safe, added,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&ldquo;We&amp;nbsp;are excited to&amp;nbsp;invite&amp;nbsp;the whole community to enjoy these free, family-friendly moments at Director Park,&amp;nbsp;make a day of it,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;explore&amp;nbsp;the shops, caf&eacute;s, and small businesses that bring Downtown to life.&rdquo;&amp;nbsp;&ldquo;It&rsquo;s one of&amp;nbsp;my favorite times of year to be&amp;nbsp;Downtown,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;this is&amp;nbsp;one of the&amp;nbsp;best ways to celebrate the season.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

