&lt;em&gt;November 21 &ndash; December 24 |&amp;nbsp;Wednesday&ndash;Sunday,&amp;nbsp;Noon&ndash;5 p.m.&amp;nbsp;| Free&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisicarriagereturn_msfontservice,aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
