&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Letters to Santa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisicarriagereturn_msfontservice,aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;November 21 &ndash; December 24 |&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Wednesday&ndash;Sunday,&amp;nbsp;Noon&ndash;5 p.m.&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;Free&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisicarriagereturn_msfontservice,aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Kids&amp;nbsp;and kids-at-heart&amp;nbsp;can drop off&amp;nbsp;their&amp;nbsp;letters to Santa. Letters received by&amp;nbsp;December&amp;nbsp;14&amp;nbsp;(with&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;return address)&amp;nbsp;will receive a reply before the holidays.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW18061395 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; position: relative;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mike Bennett&rsquo;s Holiday Gift Shop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisicarriagereturn_msfontservice,aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;November 21 &ndash; January 4,&amp;nbsp;2026&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;Daily from 11 a.m.&ndash;7 p.m.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisicarriagereturn_msfontservice,aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Step inside Mike Bennett&rsquo;s whimsical world of art, collectibles, and holiday cheer. Central City Concern will host a Giving Tree in the gift shop for those wanting to spread holiday cheer to other families.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

