&lt;p&gt;The Portland Street Response program is hosting a &lt;a href="https://www.portland.gov/streetresponse/events/2025/11/18/portland-street-response-town-hall"&gt;town hall&lt;/a&gt; on Tuesday, November 18 from 6-7:30 p.m. at the East Portland Community Center (740 SE 106th Ave, Portland OR 97216).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The event will share program updates and an overview of the Portland Street Response Aftercare team. There will be time for the community to ask questions and provide perspectives about this important resource.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
