     &lt;li&gt;2024-1-00215-06- Clark County, Washington
     &lt;ul style="list-style-type:circle"&gt;
          &lt;li&gt;Defendant to enter guilty plea to Ct. 1: Child Molestation in the First Degree&lt;/li&gt;
