&lt;p&gt;Myrna Jensen, 907-350-6260,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="mailto:jensen@oregonrn.org" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank"&gt;jensen@oregonrn.org&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
